This repository contains the scripts and command lines used in the analyses presented in the manuscript:

Plant-microbiome-genome coupling promotes incipient ecological speciation

Contents
Population genomic analyses
Structural variation analyses
Microbiome analyses
Transcriptome analyses
Metabolomic analyses
Figure generation scripts

Availability
To ensure consistency between the reviewed and published versions, the repository remains private at this stage. 
All scripts and analysis workflows will be released publicly upon publication of the manuscript.
